"color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;font-size: 16px;\"><section style=\"\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004252\" data-ratio=\"0.3328125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7iaibr8dnsRThmG3XaebvdQQZ9GO9X6AtNx9lG17NwYlctYyblwkSTCiaQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><br  /></section></section></section></section><section style=\"color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;font-size: 16px;\"><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;\"><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 7px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: flex-start;height: auto;border-width: 0px;line-height: 0;z-index: 1;padding-right: 4px;\"><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;text-align: justify;justify-content: flex-start;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: flex-start;height: auto;border-top: 2px solid rgb(102, 72, 62);border-top-left-radius: 0px;\"><section style=\"text-align: right;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 10px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: none none solid solid;border-width: 1px 0px 2px 2px;border-color: rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"margin-top: 3px;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 8px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid solid solid none;border-width: 2px 2px 1px 0px;border-color: rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(255, 64, 64);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;line-height: 0;letter-spacing: 0px;z-index: 1;padding-left: 4px;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;text-align: right;justify-content: flex-end;transform: rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: bottom;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: flex-end;height: auto;border-top: 2px solid rgb(102, 72, 62);border-top-left-radius: 0px;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 10px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: none solid solid none;border-width: 1px 2px 2px 1px;border-color: rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(255, 64, 64);\"><section style=\"margin-top: 3px;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 8px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid none solid solid;border-width: 2px 1px 1px 2px;border-color: rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -6px;margin-bottom: -6px;\"><section><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">开局我们可以通过碎片合成及英雄自选箱获得以上八个人物：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>武将：</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>【吕布】【关羽】【孙策】</strong><br  /></span><strong>文官：<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\">【郭嘉】【貂蝉】</span></strong><br  /><strong>全才：<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\">【赵云】【张辽】【孙尚香】</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br  />其中：<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>【赵云】，【吕布】【郭嘉】【孙策】</strong></span>属于合击英雄，顾名思义就是和对应的宿命英雄一起上阵可以释放合击技能的英雄</p></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: 50%;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004250\" data-ratio=\"1.0503731343283582\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7ZAtdklZictAzsdUicK7ETCtG5lelhFUlzicKG1Qvu4uA9SJia4IKeFicMrw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"536\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: 50%;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004251\" data-ratio=\"1.0521415270018621\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7a1gWhZrb74nYNpKQP0Ex0tqbf70avRjyEwsgqftaYjhboO07gQCXbQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"537\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section></section><p><br  /></p><section><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>【关羽】【貂蝉】【张辽】【孙尚香】属于宿命英雄</strong></span>，宿命英雄自带一个<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>连携属性</strong></span>，和连携的合击英雄同时上阵会有特殊连携属性。</p><p><br  /></p><p>知道初始八英雄后，我们就可以通过合击宿命和英雄兵种两个方面进行前期的阵容选择；</p></section><p><br  /></p><section><p><strong>首先是宿命合击可以分为四组：</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>赵云关羽，貂蝉吕布，孙策孙尚香，郭嘉张辽</strong></span>，这四组阵容的两个英雄都可互相触发合击宿命，一般初始我们选择英雄培养的时候都会选择其中一组。</p></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -1px;margin-bottom: -1px;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 50px;height: auto;\"><img data-imgfileid=\"100004248\" data-ratio=\"0.38\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/LHdtlaBo22eibzJO9zneaJ4LRmVsYUSob1tZj1opdBvyS5JajFoQDVxrK7Y0y0eBVyY2icUVTM9fQJA0Pk0ibic4mgHuRQls8DBic/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"svg\" data-w=\"300\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>赵云关羽组</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"\"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>平民和低氪玩家我们推荐主赵云副关羽</strong>，</span>主要是赵云的培养成本相对较低，装备和技能选择方向多；</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>高投入玩家推荐主关羽副赵云</strong></span>，高战关羽砍头还是很赏心悦目的，但是关羽需要投入的成本比较高，需要在远回合学习夺志，枪神等氪金技能抢输出压低对方兵力，也需要<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>沧海套，啸月套</strong></span>这些套装提升武力等四维。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>如果是主赵云副关羽，那么第三个将可以选择郭嘉，张星彩，糜夫人</strong></span>；这样第三将后面可以直接转化为赵云副将。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>平民第一选择肯定是</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>郭嘉</strong></span>，因为郭嘉获取成本和难度都是最低的，开局就能弄到；<strong>张星彩</strong>需要等到第21天，前期无法获取会拖慢血战沙场的节奏；<strong>糜夫人</strong>是庆典女将，运气程度比较高，碎片需要氪金。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>如果是主关羽副赵云，主推张星彩</strong></span>，张星彩可以提供四维和兵力，这两个对于关羽来说很重要；<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>其次是张辽</strong></span>，张辽分解的技能碎片不是关羽必须的，张辽后军术士可以消耗掉这个整容多余的术士技能碎片；</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>可以推导出两组主流的阵容：</strong></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>赵云，关羽，郭嘉（张星彩，糜夫人）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004249\" data-ratio=\"0.37856328392246297\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7ibARaTgks0GiaJJAMFmNBZ3jYfuicibVTJCyFBuxo87vJgfdV69L1LIfHw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"877\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>关羽，赵云，张星彩（张辽，糜夫人）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004256\" data-ratio=\"0.3778280542986425\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7S2yB6ibaheoGeHFIKskrxgpW9K9esTGoU1BGOo2nQsEeibE2rYI662Nw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"884\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -1px;margin-bottom: -1px;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 50px;height: auto;\"><img data-imgfileid=\"100004254\" data-ratio=\"0.38\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/LHdtlaBo22eibzJO9zneaJ4LRmVsYUSob1tZj1opdBvyS5JajFoQDVxrK7Y0y0eBVyY2icUVTM9fQJA0Pk0ibic4mgHuRQls8DBic/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"svg\" data-w=\"300\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>貂蝉吕布组</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"\"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>貂蝉吕布两个英雄需要投入的资源比较多，其中貂蝉需要开服获得舜英伞，吕布需要获得夺志和符印</strong></span>，这两个英雄需要投入的资源较多，当然对应强度也不差，大家可以权衡考虑；</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>主貂蝉的话，二将吕布，三将可以选择赵云，张星彩，步练师等英雄</strong></span>，选择张星彩和步练师（庆典女将）需要注意术士兵种技能会出现短缺，貂蝉，吕布也是后军术士。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>主吕布的话，二将貂蝉，三将推荐张星彩，关羽等</strong></span>，张星彩一样需要注意术士兵种技能会出现短缺，关羽后军是弓兵可以错开和貂蝉吕布的术士重复。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>可以推导出两组主流的阵容：</strong></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>貂蝉，吕布，赵云（张星彩，步练师）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004255\" data-ratio=\"0.3858632676709154\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7wYBDfMZD13440Mng0ygHIuMdkQMjibTE0iamJoFTib7tWfyYrmUtxw34w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"863\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>吕布，貂蝉，关羽（张星彩，孙鲁班，糜夫人）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004257\" data-ratio=\"0.3671003717472119\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7zHPs24L8nzHjicrh1IIlz9oGeOzHy30YyqoRd8ykYb52LGfa1iatJsqA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1076\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -1px;margin-bottom: -1px;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 50px;height: auto;\"><img data-imgfileid=\"100004253\" data-ratio=\"0.38\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/LHdtlaBo22eibzJO9zneaJ4LRmVsYUSob1tZj1opdBvyS5JajFoQDVxrK7Y0y0eBVyY2icUVTM9fQJA0Pk0ibic4mgHuRQls8DBic/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"svg\" data-w=\"300\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>孙策孙尚香组</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"\"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>孙策堪称一赛季最划算的神将</strong></span>，首先神孙策的强度在一赛季是足够的，其次是<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>孙策的培养成本很低</strong></span>，也就比赵云高一点点，缺点是孙策没有神觉醒之前输出严重不足。</p><p><br  /></p><p>俗话说，穷养儿富养女，孙尚香相比她哥哥需要的资源就要多很多了，首先是技能，<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>孙尚香觉醒后需要连弩技能，装备需要花费元宝去抽取青琅壶，武器需要S2赛季元宝购买龙舌弓</strong></span>。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>主孙策，二将孙尚香，三将推荐张星彩，也可以马云禄</strong></span>；如果选择<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>张星彩</strong></span>就需要注意<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>三个将前军都是步兵，步兵技能会出现短缺的情况</strong></span>；选择马云禄作为副将好像是女将一赛季<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>最多可以学五个英雄技能</strong></span>，战力会比选择男将高一点点。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>主孙尚香，二将孙策，三将推荐张星彩，郭嘉等</strong></span>；这个阵容一样需要注意前军步兵技能分配问题。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>可以推导出两组主流的阵容：</strong></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>孙策，孙尚香，张星彩（马云禄）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004259\" data-ratio=\"0.3810623556581986\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7rLIZyA7iabjev9Rg0p5ObIia2YUNjcSLibrNy4djB3zCecicduiaYfiaJt9g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"866\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>孙尚香，孙策，张星彩（郭嘉）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004260\" data-ratio=\"0.37583892617449666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7rXuXjekicdwJRGC1RcVPsYke5c5rhcGAkYKibfGib2fkdKuMdB0rOpHVA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1043\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -1px;margin-bottom: -1px;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 50px;height: auto;\"><img data-imgfileid=\"100004258\" data-ratio=\"0.38\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/LHdtlaBo22eibzJO9zneaJ4LRmVsYUSob1tZj1opdBvyS5JajFoQDVxrK7Y0y0eBVyY2icUVTM9fQJA0Pk0ibic4mgHuRQls8DBic/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"svg\" data-w=\"300\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>郭嘉张辽组</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"\"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>郭嘉当前版本属于大后期英雄</strong></span>，输出手段只有一发奇策，<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>想强势需要能补足近战输出的战国玉虎和能够战斗开始回合几率额外释放一发奇策的步练师</strong></span>。觉醒天赋中每提升<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>1点统率</strong></span>，相应的<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>智力也提升1点</strong></span>的效果确保了当前版本郭嘉智力天花板的地位；</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>张辽：一个身为步兵克星却被帅印克制的男人</strong></span>；张辽的天赋都是为了<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>骑兵闪击技能</strong></span>服务，这就导致了张辽极其依赖<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>闪击</strong></span>，但是<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>张辽觉醒后闪击的大部分伤害来自百分比效果</strong></span>，所以张辽很怕<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>帅印</strong></span>。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>主郭嘉，二将张辽，三将可以赵云，张星彩，步练师</strong></span>；需要注意的步练师属于庆典女将，不是固定时间出的，建议可以选择<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>赵云或者张星彩</strong></span>过渡。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>主张辽，二将郭嘉，三将张星彩，糜夫人，关银屏</strong></span>；关银屏和糜夫人都属于庆典女将，如果没有遇到，推荐张星彩即可。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>可以推导出两组主流的阵容：</strong></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>郭嘉，张辽，张星彩（赵云，步练师）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004261\" data-ratio=\"0.380897583429229\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx79ibgJ2ibIsCv9S7MhmD9WWzRfGmxzhBs0kVDhVgibbt5xS7iac8GLvsk1g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"869\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom-color: rgb(219, 205, 163);min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>张辽，郭嘉，张星彩（关银屏，糜夫人）</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;\"><section style=\"transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px) rotateX(180deg);\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 6px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 460px;background-color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><br  /></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;text-align: center;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004262\" data-ratio=\"0.3740530303030303\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNFv2yLspcvJiaribvzcpnBqx7mb9LaBRyEjyzFTghWkCear6uaQluQibEicwoelLUnfy5tP9q40SQic3yA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1056\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -1px;margin-bottom: -1px;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin-top: 20px;margin-bottom: 10px;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;height: auto;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 50px;height: auto;\"><img data-imgfileid=\"100004263\" data-ratio=\"0.38\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/LHdtlaBo22eibzJO9zneaJ4LRmVsYUSob1tZj1opdBvyS5JajFoQDVxrK7Y0y0eBVyY2icUVTM9fQJA0Pk0ibic4mgHuRQls8DBic/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"svg\" data-w=\"300\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p><strong>职业克制</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"\"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>顾名思义，<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>游戏内三个职业是互相克制的</strong></span>。</p><p><br  /></p><p>在游戏内展现效果就是<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>我方英雄激活指定宿命且职业克制敌方时，造成伤害额外提升，受到伤害额外降低，职业克制方英雄部队死亡后，会对被克制方额外造成一次伤害</strong></span>。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>所以我们一般都会选择能够克制敌方大部分英雄的阵容去培养</strong></span>；</p><p><br  /></p><p>例如敌方国家主赵云的玩家多，我们就能选择孙策和关羽进行针对，敌方国家主孙策玩家多，我们对应的可以选择貂蝉和郭嘉进行克制，只要贯彻<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>文官克武将，武将克全才，全才克文官</strong></span>的理念就行。</p><p><br  /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong>没有无敌的英雄，只有最强的主公。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\"><strong><br  /></strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;font-size: 16px;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br  /></p></section><section style=\"color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;font-size: 16px;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 14px;\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;\"></span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"transform: scale(0.95);transform-origin: center center;margin-top: -3px;margin-bottom: -3px;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100003502\" data-ratio=\"0.3333333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNEct3rLiab3maAEflsdicFTicUT0q79UG41g9PbYgdA9eAdBq72uo0EiameQRuykP6ZN9L0sljqcsCo7Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\"  /></section></section>